                  <tr id="public-rates_com-cashback">
                    <th class="table-subtitle" scope="row"><a href="/business/credit-cards/commercial-cards-program/commercial-cash-back-visa.html" title="RBC Registered Commercial Cash Back Visa Double Dagger">RBC<span style="text-decoration:none"><sup>®
                          </sup></span>Commercial Cash Back Visa<span style="text-decoration:none"><sup>‡</sup></span></a></th>
                  <td>19.99</td><td>22.99</td></tr>
                  <tr id="public-rates_commerical">
                    <th class="table-subtitle" scope="row"><a href="/business/credit-cards/commercial-cards-program/commercial-visa.html" title="RBC Registered Commercial Visa Double Dagger">RBC<span style="text-decoration:none"><sup>®
                          </sup></span>Commercial Visa<span style="text-decoration:none"><sup>‡</sup></span></a></th>
                  <td>19.99</td><td>22.99</td></tr>
                  <tr id="public-rates_com-usd">
                    <th class="table-subtitle" scope="row"><a href="/business/credit-cards/commercial-cards-program/commercial-us-dollar-visa.html" title="RBC Registered Commercial U.S. Dollar Visa Double Dagger">RBC<span style="text-decoration:none"><sup>®
                          </sup></span>Commercial U.S. Dollar Visa<span style="text-decoration:none"><sup>‡</sup></span></a></th>
                  <td>19.99</td><td>22.99</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="divider mar-tb-hlf"></div>

          <!-- r: spacing 60px -->
          <div class="sub-section">
            <div class="callout horizontal">
              <div class="callout-img icon-80 bg-grey pad-t-dbl"><img src="/credit-cards/app/assets/icn-allcards.svg" class="icon-80 mar-tb-hlf" alt="credit cards"></div>
              <div class="callout-content">
                <div class="callout-copy">
                  <h3>Learn more about RBC cards</h3>
                  <p>Offers many credit options to suit your individual or family needs. Whether you’re looking for
                    travel points, rewards, cash back, or a lower interest rate, our credit cards have you covered.
                    Learn more about each card to find the right credit card for you.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="callout-link">
                  <a href="/credit-cards/index.html" class="btn primary">Explore RBC Credit Cards</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- r: spacing 60px -->
          <div class="sub-section">

            <p class="text-small text-bold">NOTES</p>
            <ul class="text-disclaimer">
              <li class="text-small">Interest rates are per annum and subject to change without notice at any time.</li>
              <li class="text-small">Your interest rate will increase by 5% on purchases and cash advances for at least
                6 months if you do not make your minimum payment by the payment due date and you have not paid it by
                the date we prepare your next statement 2 or more times in any 12-month period. This will take effect
                in the third statement period following the missed payment that caused the rate to increase. (This does
                not apply to Commercial Cards.)</li>
              <li class="text-small">Our Prime Rate is the annual rate of interest announced by the Royal Bank of
                Canada from time to time and posted at our branches and on our website as a reference rate then in
                effect for determining interest rates of Canadian dollar commercial loans in Canada.</li>
              <!-- 	          <li class="text-small" id="legal-2">** As of June 2014 the RBC Private Banking Visa‡ Infinite product is no longer offered.</li> -->
              <li class="text-small" id="legal-3">*** As of November 2016 the RBC Rewards Visa Gold product is no
                longer offered.</li>
              <li class="text-small" id="legal-4">**** As of May 2017 the RBC<sup>®</sup> Esso<sup>‡</sup>
                Visa<sup>‡</sup> product is no longer offered.</li>
              <li class="text-small" id="legal-5">***** As of June 2017 the RBC Royal Bank Visa Cash Back product is no
                longer offered.</li>
              <li class="text-small" id="legal-6">****** As of September 2023 the RBC Cathay Pacific Visa Platinum product is no longer offered.</li>
              <li class="text-small">For more details, please refer to your RBC Royal Bank Credit Card Agreement.<br>Click
                here: <a href="http://www.rbcroyalbank.com/credit-cards/documentation.html">http://www.rbcroyalbank.com/credit-cards/documentation.html</a></li>
              <li class="text-small"><sup>®</sup>/™&nbsp;&nbsp;Trademark(s) of Royal Bank of Canada. RBC and Royal Bank
                are registered trademarks of Royal Bank of Canada.</li>
              <li class="text-small"><sup>‡</sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;All other trademarks are the property of their respective
                owner(s).</li>
            </ul>

          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

